{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put together the ultimate defence to protect your base in these post-apocalyptic wastelands! Every metal scrap will be needed to create unique and deadly towers and annihilate every enemy vehicle that comes your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend several post-apocalyptic bases in our challenging Scenarios or play in Endless Mode and see how long you can defend your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/BTUD_SW_TextBanner.png?t=1748480299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build unique and deadly towers, each with unique abilities! Upgrade your towers' strengths to best suit your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/TowerBuild.gif?t=1748480299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/EM_SW_TextBanner.png?t=1748480299\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight for as long as you can in Endless Mode! Infinite playtime and an ever-increasing number of enemies create a difficult and rewarding challenge! Choose which Scenarios to play in Endless Mode! Try to obtain the mastery badge in all 3 scenarios in Endless Mode as you change your strategies to fit the enemies invading your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/EnvirnomentSC.gif?t=1748480299\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/CS_SW_TextBanner.png?t=1748480299\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock 3 challenging scenarios where you must defend your scrap base against an entourage of varying enemies, each scenario requiring different strategies and different towers! Each Scenario takes place in a new and interesting location! Explore Scrapland and defend the last strongholds of humanity! Gain badges for your success and try to get the mastery badge on all 3 scenarios!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/BadgeClip.gif?t=1748480299\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658630?t=1748480299","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/b360f9b691aac64628ffd8c6c67b997691e6fec1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748480299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/9a627c06914a7a21785e0b670275375c780c087c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748480299","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/9a627c06914a7a21785e0b670275375c780c087c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748480299","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3767330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put together the ultimate defence to protect your base in these post-apocalyptic wastelands! Every metal scrap will be needed to create unique and deadly towers and annihilate every enemy vehicle that comes your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend several post-apocalyptic bases in our challenging Scenarios or play in Endless Mode and see how long you can defend your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/